  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Programme on Economic and Financial Management Integration for the Achievement of SDGs (JP-EFMIS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to support Lesotho to establish a functional and sustainable integrated planning and Private Finance Management (PFM) ecosystem that contributes to accelerated achievement of the SDGs targets and the National Strategic Development Plan. The project supports the Government of Lesotho to achieve private sector-led economic growth and employment creation, by facilitating creation of conducive policy environment, strengthening PFM processes, providing platforms for dialogue and generating evidence for private&#x2013;public collaboration. The project will further enable the government to realize the NSDP II objectives by unlocking opportunities to fast track implementation of the Economic Labs project, which is a government programme towards mobilizing large scale private investments into Lesotho.</narrative>
  </description>
